OL,3,AOne dead and several hurt after
OL,4,Arollercoaster incident at Six Flags
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains some
OL,7,Fgraphic details
OL,9,FOne person has died and several others
OL,10,Fwere injured after an incident on a
OL,11,Frollercoaster at an amusement park in
OL,12,Fthe state of Georgia.
OL,14,FThe Cobb County Police Department said
OL,15,Fit was investigating the fatality at
OL,16,FSix Flags Over Georgia, about 15 miles
OL,17,F(24km) from Atlanta, according to the
OL,18,FBBC's news partner CBS News.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
